{"id": "DdgTcVTT7je", "title": "Video by therishikatha", "description": "जब सती माँ ने अग्नि में प्राण त्यागे, महादेव का हृदय भी टूट गया… 🔥💔\nशिव शून्य हो गए, सृष्टि अनाथ हो गई…\nऔर तब शिव-शक्ति के पुनर्मिलन हेतु,\nआदि शक्ति ने जन्म लिया शैलराज हिमवान के घर —\nमाँ शैलपुत्री रूप में। 🙏⛰️\nतपस्या की, मिलन हुआ, और सृष्टि का उद्धार हो गया।\nयही हैं नवदुर्गा की प्रथम शक्ति — माँ शैलपुत्री। 🌸#mahadev #parvati #shailputri", "channel": "therishikatha", "uploader_id": "22569163881", "uploader": "Rishi Katha", "timestamp": 1789898066, "like_count": 181, "comment_count": 6, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-927406163776390a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 54.784, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQOJzkLe9nOlkLScK7M_BDqJOWB0jH88Rz4tzNKA3o4bU4bSMlIj6faoqYLEk47CVTD64bPgUFKwJXU5oCoI-brF7KCk7r36eyizJlc.mp4?_nc_cat=106&_nc_oc=AdoAkgnnpcwKXwBPzoFNf688_ASGCKY3QXMhedd3n_0Y8RAa2xXPUwc9-x8WSTpD30aZLf34NoDyJ5nYXz25pAWi&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=udQIid9u79EQ7kNvwGQ22JN&&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=z8ls8nb_oR-iw_1ZLBuQ8w&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQTGnIyp8ihPZz57l73V32RQKx0TsIznA-q4WsofXNjgzQ&oe=6AF414F7", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 54.784, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/149.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "format": "dash-927406163776390a - audio only (DASH audio)"}, {"url": "https://instagram.fblr22-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQNgczh2S2jqP6DDdr5GZ4uHHb5fd0